  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project additional farmers will have their capacity on organic and sustainable rice production developed in Ratankiri in the Lumphat area. This is a protected site and supports indigenous people and also wildlife conservation.</narrative>
  </description>
